WEBVTT

00:00:13.702 --> 00:00:14.319
<v><b>Izzy’s voicemail:</b></v> I’m sorry.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:15.804
I can’t take your call at the moment.

00:00:15.805 --> 00:00:17.999
Please leave a message and I’ll get back to you.

00:00:19.363 --> 00:00:20.132
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi, Izzy.

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:21.605
It’s Ben.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.304
Can you call me back, please?

00:00:44.032 --> 00:00:45.144
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Light on London.

00:00:45.469 --> 00:00:46.581
How can I help you?

00:00:47.356 --> 00:00:47.747
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:51.365
Can I speak to Izzy Silva, please?

00:01:04.026 --> 00:01:06.201
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Just a second, I’ll put you through…

00:01:08.341 --> 00:01:08.750
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Izzy?

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:19.050
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Sorry, she’s not at her desk right now.

00:01:19.688 --> 00:01:21.040
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Can I leave a message, please?

00:01:28.684 --> 00:01:29.243
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Sure.

00:01:29.916 --> 00:01:31.184
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Can you tell her Ben called?

00:01:38.744 --> 00:01:40.108
I’ll call her back later.

00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:50.487
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> No problem, I’ll give her the message.

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:52.007
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thanks.

00:02:03.311 --> 00:02:05.697
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Light on London, how can I help you?

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:06.743
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi.

00:02:07.031 --> 00:02:09.182
Can I speak to Izzy Silva, please?

00:02:22.428 --> 00:02:31.256
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Just a second… I’m sorry, the line’s busy.

00:02:31.761 --> 00:02:32.753
Do you want to hold?

00:02:33.113 --> 00:02:33.774
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes.

00:02:34.315 --> 00:02:34.832
I’ll hold.

00:02:45.595 --> 00:02:47.776
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Hello, Izzy Silva’s phone.

00:02:48.413 --> 00:02:51.292
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Uh…Is Izzy there?

00:02:59.669 --> 00:03:00.180
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Ben?

00:03:00.769 --> 00:03:02.397
Er, no.

00:03:02.398 --> 00:03:03.804
She’s taken the day off.

00:03:05.343 --> 00:03:10.361
Er…I’d give her some space if I were you.

00:03:13.347 --> 00:03:14.489
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thanks for the advice.